			(property "Description" "XT60 connector for an M18 pack. Pin numbering follows the XT60 convention and KiCad's AMASS footprints: pin 1 = the notched/chamfered end of the housing = NEGATIVE, pin 2 = the flat end = POSITIVE (the molded + sits at the flat end). Board inputs J13/J14 are male (XT60-M); the switched winch output J16 is female (XT60-F) so its live contacts are shrouded and a battery plug cannot mate with it."
				(at 0 0 0)
				(show_name no)
				(do_not_autoplace no)
