		)
		(property "Description" "Pico 2 (RP2350) or Pico (RP2040) on two 1x20 sockets. Pins: GP0/1 RS-485 (UART0) + GP2 DE, GP4/5 I2C0, GP6/7 GPS (PIO UART), GP8/9 RC (UART1), GP10/11 CAN (can2040), GP14/15/16 ESC PWM, GP17 winch home, GP18 leak excite, GP19 pod power off, GP20/21 + GP3/12/13/22 to the 2nd-Pico header, ADC0 pack, ADC1/2 leak probes."
			(at 254.00 208.28 0)
			(hide yes)
